WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
Kandy, Sri Lanka.

2
00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:05.550
The Temple of the Tooth houses
a tooth relic of the Buddha.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.910
Buddhists bow there, and offer
flowers, light and incense.

4
00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.300
Yet many Theravada Buddhists
say the Buddha is gone.

5
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.370
In nibbana, he cannot hear or act.

6
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.550
So why do Theravada Buddhists
still bow before his image?

7
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.340
In this mission, you'll trace Theravada,
the only early school that survives,

8
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.430
and its path to the arahant.

9
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.250
Then you'll meet a scholar who asked
village Buddhists in Sri Lanka what they

10
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.290
believe.

11
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:37.010
Your mission: explain why Theravada
Buddhists bow before the image of a Buddha

12
00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.840
who has gone beyond reach.
